Author: ""

Version: # Plugin version
    Major: 1
    Minor: 0
    Revision: 0

Targets: # Low TitleId of games which are compatibles with this plugin (0 for all)

Title: Japanese OCR & Translation (N3DS Offline)

Summary: New 3DS Offline + Online Japanese OCR & Dictionary 3GX Plugin

Description: |
  Real-time screen capture, on-board offline OCR + JMdict/Kanjidic lookup,
  and optional PC server translation client for New Nintendo 3DS homebrew.
  Features:
    - Direct hotkey activation (R + Start + Select)
    - On-board PP-OCRv4 INT8 recognition & JMdict/Kanjidic offline lookup (New 3DS)
    - Single word lookup & 2-point box glossing / translation
    - Offline Anki queue + optional online PC OCR server mode

Compatibility: Any

MemorySize: 10MiB

UsePrivateMemory: false
